  "worked_solution": "Starting from the equation $a\\cdot b=-3,$ we compute the dot product in terms of $x$ and then solve for $x$ in the resulting equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\cdot b & =-3 \\\\ x\\cdot 3+2\\cdot x+1\\cdot 9+(-1)\\cdot 7 & =-3 \\\\ 3x+2x+9-7 & =-3 \\\\ 5x & =-5 \\\\ x & =-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that $x=-1.$",
